[[carnaps_quasi-analysis]]+++

= main =

== rejection of the fantasy of analysis ==
[[Leibniz#characteristica universalis]]+
The criticism being that if the resulting version of the argument is not
logically valid, the proponent of the original argument can simply maintain that
the paraphrase is inadequate and very little has been achieved.  If really
pressed they can claim that the logic in question is not adequate to the form of
argument (this is Brentano's move, commonly used to reject extensionalist
logics). By contrast on my view logic is a tool of construction. That you can
build talk of properties from relations of (symmetrical, reflexive) similarity
(and some set theory) is a genuine achievement worth noting.

